{"id": "clm:92d0bdbbc5fc294fc9f9745f4012c2f8cb51e2c45e0a484c7665bbe0b6d4090b", "type": "statement", "text": "After cancellation of Developer or self-serve Pro, Atlas reactivation of paid support triggers charges back to the date a non-Basic support plan was last active, capped at a 90-day lookback, except when moving from Developer to self-serve Pro or from self-serve Pro to subscription-linked Pro. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/support/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Retroactive support billing on reactivation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:d558e5022ab1a207abe43a6ec659a40df45e785e5ef1a3240a496c3512b67b74", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:f4b8d14caef5048df996869e43b0de8081f28ef8f81cc5803a5735305636b76b"]}
{"id": "clm:ffa10f83312ed67273a2744c910ff3474191cddf7ef256649525be4b2100c61b", "type": "statement", "text": "The Atlas support page says cancellation during a trial stops billing immediately; cancellation outside a trial takes effect at month-end, with billing continuing until then. It also says changing support plans changes billing on the first day of the next month. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/support.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Retroactive support billing on reactivation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:d558e5022ab1a207abe43a6ec659a40df45e785e5ef1a3240a496c3512b67b74", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c5abb8731ea90bf3b4e522664ccb44948997fb8812c3e6a71f945766f276577a", "ev:f50baf1c429ec38abe1cfe3605d7c5409663a8845af4ff91a49baf5b58dc30b1"]}
{"id": "clm:5f4a8187892a41f7434646fc169b5b343ed68bdbbfc7892949351c3000a3ffbf", "type": "statement", "text": "The Atlas support page inspected in this probe does not specify a support-reactivation lookback window or a retroactive charge for an inactive support interval. This is a documentation gap, not proof that every Atlas agreement excludes such charges. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/support.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Retroactive support billing on reactivation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:d558e5022ab1a207abe43a6ec659a40df45e785e5ef1a3240a496c3512b67b74", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ac8010ee2e4c0de663e4606dea238378991405e5335a6a87ee37f846fad8d1a7"]}
{"id": "clm:0a101ee1c097ed415394d870ee858cbeb214e546c6bab0d75c4a0953befb0d76", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas exempts two transitions from retroactive billing: Developer to self-serve Pro, and self-serve Pro to subscription-linked Pro. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/support/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Retroactive support billing on reactivation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:d558e5022ab1a207abe43a6ec659a40df45e785e5ef1a3240a496c3512b67b74", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:f4b8d14caef5048df996869e43b0de8081f28ef8f81cc5803a5735305636b76b"]}
{"id": "clm:ec204c290ee389fef9ef26e04d0586d488a514ecfbac71ca25e26a0fdb570843", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas cancellation outside a trial takes effect at month-end, with billing continuing until then; trial cancellation stops billing immediately. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/support/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Retroactive support billing on reactivation"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:d558e5022ab1a207abe43a6ec659a40df45e785e5ef1a3240a496c3512b67b74", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:473f516af9967a1523438074e539e0e797ef30a791b241117ac0f74fdd833a89"]}
